{"id":3900,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/adverbs-frequency/","parentId":540,"order":65,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Adverbs of frequency with present simple","seo":{"title":"Adverbs of frequency with present simple - Test-English","description":"Learn to use adverbs of frequency in the present simple with fun examples and exercises in this A1 elementary English grammar lesson!","image":"/media/uploads/A1%E2%80%93Grammar_Adverbs-frequency.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T10:29:26","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Order the following sentences, which contain adverbs of frequency.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"447\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct options to complete the sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"448\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Rewrite the sentences using the adverbs of frequency or the expressions of frequency in the correct position.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"449\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2>Adverbs of frequency</h2> <p>We use adverbs of frequency with the present simple to talk about how often something happens.<br> <br> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10991\" src=\"/media/uploads/adverbs_frequency_new.png\" alt=\"Educational chart for A1 elementary English learners showing adverbs of frequency with percentages and examples, plus word order rules in positive sentences and questions.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h4>Position</h4> <p>The <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/basic-word-order-in-english/\">position</a> of adverbs of frequency is <strong>before the verb</strong> but <strong>after</strong> the verb&nbsp;<strong>be</strong>.<br> <br> In <strong>negative sentences</strong>, the adverb of frequency goes after <strong>don’t/doesn’t</strong>:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>We don’t <span><strong>often</strong></span> go to bed late.</em></li> <li><em>He doesn’t <span><strong>always</strong></span> agree with me. &nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>In <strong>questions</strong>, adverbs of frequency go after the subject.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Is he <strong><span>always</span></strong> late?</em></li> <li><em>Do they <strong><span>often</span></strong> go to the library?</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Never/hardly ever</strong></h4> <p>The adverbs <strong>never</strong> and <strong>hardly ever </strong>(=almost never)&nbsp;have a negative meaning, but they are used with a positive verb:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>He <span><strong>is never</strong></span> late.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>He <span><strong>isn’t never</strong></span> late.</em> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>They <span><strong>hardly ever go</strong></span> to the library.&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em>They <span><strong>don’t hardly ever go</strong></span> to the library.&nbsp;</em><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> </ul> <h2>Expressions of frequency</h2> <p>There are other expressions that we use to talk about frequency: <strong>once a day, twice a week, three times a month, every day, etc</strong>. These expressions are longer (2 words or more), and they go at the end of the sentence.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I brush my teeth <span><strong>three times a day</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I see her <span><strong>every day</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":447,"questions":[{"id":3890,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7870,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Our teacher is often late.</span>"},{"id":7871,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Our teacher often is late.</span>"},{"id":7872,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Is often our teacher late?</span>"},{"id":7873,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Often our teacher is late.</span>"}]},{"id":3891,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7874,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Never we eat fast food.</span>"},{"id":7875,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>We eat never fast food. </span>"},{"id":7876,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>We eat fast food never. </span>"},{"id":7877,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>We never eat fast food.</span>"}]},{"id":3892,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7878,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>My father doesn't hardly ever watch football on TV.</span>"},{"id":7879,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>My father watches hardly ever football on TV.</span>"},{"id":7880,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>My father watches football on TV hardly ever.</span>"},{"id":7881,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>My father hardly ever watches football on TV.</span>"}]},{"id":3893,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7882,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Do often you go to the cinema?</span>"},{"id":7883,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Do you often go to the cinema?</span>"},{"id":7884,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Do you go often to the cinema?</span>"},{"id":7885,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Do you go to the cinema often?</span>"}]},{"id":3894,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7886,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>He usually doesn't go to bed late.</span>"},{"id":7887,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>He doesn't go to bed late usually.</span>"},{"id":7888,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>He doesn't usually go to bed late.</span>"},{"id":7889,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Does he go usually late to bed?</span>"}]},{"id":3895,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7850,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>I every week have piano lessons. </span>"},{"id":7851,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>I have every week piano lessons. </span>"},{"id":7852,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>I have piano lessons every week. </span>"},{"id":7853,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>I every week have piano lessons. </span>"}]},{"id":3896,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7854,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>They always are very tired after the match.</span>"},{"id":7855,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>They are always very tired after the match.</span>"},{"id":7856,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>They are very tired after the match always.</span>"},{"id":7857,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>Always they are very tired after the match.</span>"}]},{"id":3897,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div> Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7858,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>We always have breakfast at home.</span>"},{"id":7859,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Always we have breakfast at home.</span>"},{"id":7860,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>We have always breakfast at home.</span>"},{"id":7861,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>We have breakfast at home always.</span>"}]},{"id":3898,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7862,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>She doesn't wear jeans often.</span>"},{"id":7863,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>She often doesn't wear jeans.</span>"},{"id":7864,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Often she doesn't wear jeans.</span>"},{"id":7865,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>She doesn't often wear jeans.</span>"}]},{"id":3899,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Which sentence is correct?</div>","choices":[{"id":7866,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Are you sometimes tired at the end of the class?</span>"},{"id":7867,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Are sometimes you tired at the end of the class?</span>"},{"id":7868,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Are you tired sometimes at the end of the class?</span>"},{"id":7869,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>You are sometimes tired at the end of the class?</span>"}]}]},{"id":448,"questions":[{"id":3900,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Tom _____ to the radio.</div>","choices":[{"id":5883,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>never listens</span>"},{"id":5884,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>doesn't never listen</span>"},{"id":5885,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>never doesn't listen</span>"}]},{"id":3901,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ in class on time?</div>","choices":[{"id":5886,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Is always your teacher</span>"},{"id":5887,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Is your teacher always</span>"},{"id":5888,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Always is your teacher</span>"}]},{"id":3902,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He _____ his homework. </div>","choices":[{"id":5889,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>hardly ever doesn't do</span>"},{"id":5890,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>doesn't hardly ever do</span>"},{"id":5891,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>hardly ever does</span>"}]},{"id":3903,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He _____ to class. </div>","choices":[{"id":5892,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>doesn't always go</span>"},{"id":5893,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>always doesn't go</span>"},{"id":5894,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>doesn't go always</span>"}]},{"id":3904,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Alice and Tom _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":5895,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>cook every day dinner</span>"},{"id":5896,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>every day cook diner</span>"},{"id":5897,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>cook dinner every day</span>"}]},{"id":3905,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She _____ during dinner. </div>","choices":[{"id":5898,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>has hardly ever wine</span>"},{"id":5899,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>hardly ever has wine</span>"},{"id":5900,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>has wine hardly ever </span>"}]},{"id":3906,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>What time _____ at the weekend?</div>","choices":[{"id":5901,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>do you usually get up</span>"},{"id":5902,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>usually do you get up</span>"},{"id":5903,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>usually you get up</span>"}]},{"id":3907,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We _____ our mistakes.</div>","choices":[{"id":5904,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>don't often admit</span>"},{"id":5905,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>often don't admit</span>"},{"id":5906,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>don't admit often</span>"}]},{"id":3908,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Mark _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":5907,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>always is busy</span>"},{"id":5908,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>is busy always</span>"},{"id":5909,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>is always busy</span>"}]},{"id":3909,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>My brother _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":5910,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>reads comics sometimes</span>"},{"id":5911,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>sometimes reads comics</span>"},{"id":5912,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>reads sometimes comics</span>"}]}]},{"id":449,"questions":[{"id":3910,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She has a shower in the morning. (always) ⇒ She <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3911,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Where do you go running? (usually) ⇒ Where <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3912,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She is full of energy. (always) ⇒ She <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3914,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>My parents approve of my friends. (hardly ever) ⇒ My parents <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3918,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I listen to the radio. (every night) ⇒ I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3913,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He is strict with his students. (sometimes) ⇒ He <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3915,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't ask for help when I need it. (usually) ⇒ I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> when I need it.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3916,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He is late for school. (never) ⇒ He <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3917,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You make mistakes. (often) ⇒ You <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3919,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I meditate. (usually/twice a day) ⇒ I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}